:: Widgets Casey [widget]

<<widget "CaseyRescueCheck">>
	<<if $alarm is 1 and C.npc.Casey.love gte 41 and ($caseybaileyfight lt 1 or $caseybaileyfight is undefined)>>
        As you let out a scream, Casey quickly arrives with a shocked appearance. <<nnpc_He "Casey">> grabs a metal pipe from the trash and swings at the assailant, who cowers back and runs away. <<nnpc_He "Casey">> offers you a strong hand and helps you back to your feet.
        <br><br>
        "Are you alright? I didn't realize this place was so unsafe. You should hurry back to town."
	<</if>>
	<<if !$_noText>>
		<br><br>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>